iPhone 18 Pro, spuntano i colori: resta un solo grande dubbio

Di Redazione

2 Set 2026

<img 
                                        fetchpriority="high" 
                                        width="741" 
                                        height="486" 
                                        class="entry-thumb" 
                                        src="https://www.macitynet.it/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/colore-741x486.jpg" srcset="https://www.macitynet.it/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/colore-741x486.jpg 741w, https://www.macitynet.it/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/colore-50x34.jpg 50w" sizes="(max-width: 741px) 100vw, 741px" 
